-identity","content":"`OU`: organizational unit."},"696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-the-identity","content":"The CA's internal identifier is generated automatically and cannot be changed."},"697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configure-validity-and-uses","content":"Define **CA Certificate Expiration** and **Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**. You can express a duration (`5y 8w 4d`), pick a date or use the maximum allowed date."},"698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configure-validity-and-uses","content":"Select an existing issuance profile or configure the `Key Usage` and `Extended Key Usage` in the form. If you don't choose a profile, Lamassu applies the default basic usages."},"699":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#create-and-verify","content":"Confirm the form. The CA should appear in the inventory with its PEM certificate, status, expiration date and list of issued certificates."},"700":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#create-and-verify","co