:"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"page","content":"Device Management Service","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Operate Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"Define how a fleet receives, renews and uses its identities."},"1532":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#configure-a-dms","content":"Configure a DMS"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#identify-the-fleet","content":"Identify the fleet"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#select-the-enrollment-ca","content":"Select the enrollment CA"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#configure-the-enrollment-protocol","content":"Configure the enrollment protocol"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribute-trust","content":"Distribute trust"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#verify-the-endpoints","content":"Verify the endpoints"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#trust-distribution","content":"Trust distribution"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"Operate the DMS inventory"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#integrate-the-devices","content":"Integrate the devices"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"A &#x2A;*Device Management Service (DMS)** acts as the registration authority facing a fleet. It receives requests, applies the authentication policy and delegates issuance to the configured CA."},"1543":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"Each DMS is an independent operational boundary: it can represent a product line, an environment or a device type with its own CA, authentication rules, distributed trust and renewal window."},"1544":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"Each DMS exposes a single enrollment protocol, selected when it is created or edited: &#x2A;*EST (RFC 7030)** or &#x2A;*CMP (RFC 9483 Lightweight CMP Profile / RFC 4210)**. The two protocols are mutually exclusive: changing the protocol of an existing DMS replaces its enrollment configuration entirely, without automatic migration of settings. Each protocol's configuration and the device integration guide are documented in the EST and CMP pages."},"1545":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#before-you-begin","content":"Create or import at least one active CA."},"1546":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#before-you-begin","content":"Decide how devices will authenticate during initial enrollment."},"1547":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#before-you-begin","content":"Define which authorities the device should receive as anchors of trust."},"1548":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#before-you-begin","content":"Make sure you have permissions to administer DMSs."},"1549":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#identify-the-fleet","content":"Give the DMS a name that describes its scope, for example a device family or an environment."},"1550":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#select-the-enrollment-ca","content":"Choose the authority that will issue the identities. Its policy and validity period constrain the certificates the fleet can obtain."},"1551":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#configure-the-enrollment-protocol","content":"Select EST (RFC 7030) or CMP (RFC 9483) and define the authentication of `enroll`, the `reenroll` policy, the renewal window and, if needed, server-side key generation."},"1552":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribute-trust","content":"Configure **CA Distribution** to control which authorities the device receives as anchors of trust, regardless of the enrollment protocol."},"1553":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#verify-the-endpoints","content":"From the DMS menu, open &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** and check the base URL and the invocation examples before integrating the firmware."},"1554":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#trust-distribution","content":"**Include Lamassu System CA** distributes the TLS certificate of the Lamassu server, useful for *pinning*. It does not represent an issuing CA."},"1555":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#trust-distribution","content":"**Include Enrollment CA** adds the authority configured to issue the DMS's identities."},"1556":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#trust-distribution","content":"**Managed CAs** lets you include additional authorities the device must consider trusted."},"1557":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"**Edit** modifies the DMS policy."},"1558":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment#operate-the-dms-inventory","content":"**Go to DMS owned devices** opens only the devices of that fleet."},"1559":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-enrollment-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/pl