ear with status **No Identity** until it completes enrollment or receives a manually assigned identity."},"1596":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"The **Assign Identity** action is available while the device remains in **No Identity**."},"1597":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"Open the device and select **Assign Identity**."},"1598":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"Choose an active certificate whose `Common Name` matches the `Device ID`."},"1599":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"If none exists, select **Issue New Instead** and choose a CA linked to the DMS."},"1600":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","content":"Confirm the assignment."},"1601":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/device-management#assign-an-identity-manually","c