preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"In this flow the key is generated in the browser and Lamassu does not store it. Download it and protect it before closing the operation result."},"2265":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#start-the-issuance","content":"Open the CA created in the previous quickstart, go to **Issued Certificates** and select **Issue New**."},"2266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"Select **Generate Key & CSR in Browser**. Use **Upload Existing CSR** when the private key must be generated and kept on the target system."},"2267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"Enter the `Common Name` and, if applicable, the organization, organizational unit and location. Add SANs for each DNS name, IP address, email or URI the identity will be validated with."},"2268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Choose RSA or ECDSA, define the validity and select the key usages. For a device identity that uses mTLS, enable **Digital Signature** and **Client Authentication**."},"2269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"The validity cannot exceed the expiration date of the issuing CA."},"2270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#issue-and-download","content":"Confirm the issuance and immediately download the certificate and the private key in PEM format."},"2271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-result","content":"The certificate should appear in **Issued Certificates** with an active status. Check its subject, SANs, issuer, usages and validity period."},"2272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#next-step","content":"Register your first device to associate the identity with a managed entity, or see certificate management."},"2273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Get started","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/platfor