LS."},"256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Si los usuarios se conectan por DNS, añade el nombre a `tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.hostnames`. No copies la IP pública de un proxy upstream en `gateway.addresses`."},"257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Para una VM pequeña con K3s o MicroK8s, usa un único Gateway externo de Lamassu y enruta todos los endpoints a través de él:"},"258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Este diseño utiliza una IP, un punto de entrada TLS y un único par de puertos. El chart ya crea las rutas necesarias."},"259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s ServiceLB implementa cada Service `LoadBalancer` mediante pods que reservan los puertos del Service en el nodo. En un único nodo, solo un Service puede ocupar el puerto 80 y otro el 443. El Service Traefik que K3s instala por defecto puede estar ocupando ambos."},"260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-previe