,"content":"Crea la CA sucesora"},"613":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#distribuye-la-nueva-confianza","content":"Distribuye la nueva confianza"},"614":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cambia-la-emisión","content":"Cambia la emisión"},"615":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#renueva-por-lotes","content":"Renueva por lotes"},"616":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cierra-el-solapamiento","content":"Cierra el solapamiento"},"617":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Revocación en cascada"},"618":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Comprobaciones después del cambio"},"619":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","content":"La jerarquía determina el alcance de cualquier error o compromiso. Una raíz firma CAs intermedias; las intermedias emiten las identidades que usan dispositivos y servicios. Esta separación permite aislar entornos y rotar una rama sin reemplazar toda la confianza."},"620":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Para una instalación de producción, utiliza una raíz muy restringida y una o más intermedias operativas. Separa intermedias cuando cambie alguno de estos límites:"},"621":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"entorno, como producción y preproducción;"},"622":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"propietario o equipo operador;"},"623":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"familia de dispositivos o proceso de fabricación;"},"624":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"región o requisito regulatorio;"},"625":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"motor criptográfico o política de clave;"},"626":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"ventana de mantenimiento y ritmo de renovación."},"627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Evita jerarquías profundas sin una necesidad concreta. Cada nivel añade distribución de cadena, validación y otro certificado que debes renovar."},"628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Una CA hija y los certificados finales deben expirar antes que su emisor. Reserva un margen que permita distribuir otra cadena y renovar los certificados dependientes."},"629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"**Reemitir una CA** crea un certificado nuevo sobre la clave existente. Lamassu genera una CSR con esa clave, autofirma si es una raíz o pide a la CA padre que firme si es subordinada. El nuevo certificado queda activo y la CA apunta a su número de serie; los certificados anterior y nuevo quedan enlazados mediante metadatos."},"630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"**Rotar una CA** crea una clave y una autoridad sucesoras. Es la opción adecuada ante compromiso, cambio criptográfico, migración de motor o política de claves no exportables."},"631":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#reemisión-y-rotación-no-son-lo-mismo","content":"Lamassu no permite reemitir una CA ya revocada ni una CA cuya fecha de expiración haya pasado. Anticípate a ambas condiciones."},"632":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Reemite si la clave sigue siendo confiable y solo necesitas otro periodo de validez o un certificado actualizado."},"633":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Rota la clave si existe sospecha de compromiso, cambia el algoritmo o quieres mover la custodia a otro motor."},"634":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Crea una rama paralela si no puedes actualizar todos los consumidores al mismo tiempo."},"635":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cuándo-elegir-cada-operación","content":"Revoca inmediatamente solo cuando el riesgo de mantener la CA supera el impacto de interrumpir la flota."},"636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#inventaría-las-dependencias","content":"Localiza CAs hijas, certificados emitidos, DMS, conectores y almacenes de confianza externos. Incluye dispositivos que pueden permanecer desconectados durante semanas o meses."},"637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#crea-la-ca-sucesora","content":"Genera una clave nueva en el motor previsto, crea la CA y asígnale un perfil explícito. No reutilices el identificador operativo para ocultar que es una generación distinta."},"638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#distribuye-la-nueva-confianza","content":"Añade la nueva raíz o cadena a los consumidores antes de emitir con ella. En un DMS, utiliza las CAs gestionadas de `/cacerts` para mantener temporalmente las cadenas antigua y nueva."},"639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cambia-la-emisión","content":"Actualiza la CA de enrolamiento y el perfil de los DMS. Mantén las CAs de validación adicionales si todavía deben aceptarse certificados antiguos durante el re-enrolamiento."},"640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#renueva-por-lotes","content":"Migra una cohorte pequeña, valida mTLS, OCSP y CRL desde el consumidor y amplía progresivamente. Supervisa qué dispositivos siguen presentando la cadena antigua."},"641":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#cierra-el-solapamiento","content":"Cuando ningún consumidor legítimo dependa de la autoridad anterior, retírala de la emisión y de las CAs distribuidas. Revócala si la política lo exige."},"642":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Al revocar una CA, Lamassu actualiza también sus CAs hijas y certificados emitidos a `REVOKED` con razón `CessationOfOperation`. Las revocaciones de las hijas propagan el efecto a sus propias ramas."},"643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#revocación-en-cascada","content":"Esto protege la coherencia de la jerarquía, pero convierte la revocación en una acción de gran impacto. No la utilices como mecanismo ordinario para dejar de emitir: primero completa la migración y elimina la CA de los flujos operativos."},"644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"La cadena nueva termina en un ancla instalada por el consumidor."},"645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Los certificados nuevos contienen AKI, SKI, KU, EKU y SAN esperados."},"646":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"El DMS entrega la cadena correcta mediante EST `/cacerts`."},"647":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"El re-enrolamiento acepta la identidad antigua durante el periodo previsto."},"648":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"OCSP y CRL responden para las autoridades que siguen activas."},"649":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"No quedan DMS emitiendo accidentalmente desde la CA anterior."},"650":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#comprobaciones-después-del-cambio","content":"Consulta el Modelo de confianza para entender los conjuntos de CAs del DMS y Ciclo de vida de un certificado para los estados y efectos de revocación."},"651":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"page","content":"Autoridades de certificación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities"},"652":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI."},"653":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"Elige un flujo"},"654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-una-autoridad-nueva","content":"Crea una autoridad nueva"},"655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#abre-el-asistente","content":"Abre el asistente"},"657":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Configura la clave"},"658":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-el-tipo-de-ca","content":"Elige el tipo de CA"},"659":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"Define la identidad"},"660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Configura validez y usos"},"661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Crea y verifica"},"662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Utiliza una clave del KMS"},"663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#importa-una-ca-externa","content":"Importa una CA externa"},"664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#selecciona-el-motor","content":"Selecciona el motor"},"665":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#carga-el-material","content":"Carga el material"},"666":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-emisión-predeterminada","content":"Define la emisión predeterminada"},"667":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Verifica la importación"},"668":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Inspecciona una autoridad"},"669":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Emite certificados"},"670":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#revoca-una-ca","content":"Revoca una CA"},"671":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#evalúa-el-impacto","content":"Evalúa el impacto"},"672":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inicia-la-revocación","content":"Inicia la revocación"},"673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#confirma-la-identidad","content":"Confirma la identidad"},"674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"Comprueba la publicación"},"675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Una autoridad de certificación (CA) vincula identidades con claves públicas mediante certificados firmados. En Lamassu puedes crear una jerarquía nueva, utilizar una clave que ya está en el KMS o incorporar una CA externa."},"676":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Para diseñar una cadena completa o sustituir una autoridad en producción, consulta Jerarquía y rotación de CAs. Si necesitas estandarizar qué puede firmar cada autoridad, utiliza Perfiles de certificado."},"677":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Nueva CA y nueva clave:** crea una raíz de confianza desde cero. Lamassu genera y custodia el par de claves."},"678":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Nueva CA desde KMS:** reutiliza una clave que ya está registrada en la plataforma."},"679":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Importar CA con clave privada:** incorpora una autoridad externa con la que Lamassu podrá emitir."},"680":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Importar solo el certificado:** añade una autoridad para construir cadenas y validar, pero no para emitir."},"681":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"¿Es tu primera vez? Sigue Crea tu primera CA para completar el recorrido mínimo."},"682":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Decide si la CA será raíz o intermedia."},"683":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave."},"684":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Define una validez superior a la de los certificados que emitirá."},"685":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Para una CA intermedia, asegúrate de que la CA padre esté activa."},"686":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#abre-el-asistente","content":"En **Certification Authorities**, selecciona **Create New CA** y elige generar un par de claves nuevo."},"687":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Selecciona el motor criptográfico, el algoritmo y el tamaño o curva. Lamassu admite claves RSA y EC según las capacidades del motor."},"688":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Para RSA puedes elegir 1024, 2048, 3072 o 4096 bits. Para EC están disponibles las curvas P-256, P-384 y P-521."},"689":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-el-tipo-de-ca","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** para una autoridad autofirmada o **Intermediate CA** para una autoridad firmada por otra CA. En el segundo caso, elige la CA emisora."},"690":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"Introduce un **CA Name** único. Este nombre se convierte en el `Common Name` del certificado. Completa los campos del Distinguished Name que necesite tu política:"},"691":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`C`: código de país ISO 3166-1 de dos letras."},"692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`ST`: estado o provincia."},"693":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`L`: localidad."},"694":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`O`: organización."},"695":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`OU`: unidad organizativa."},"696":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"El identificador interno de la CA se genera automáticamente y no se puede modificar."},"697":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Define **CA Certificate Expiration** y **Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**. Puedes expresar una duración (`5y 8w 4d`), seleccionar una fecha o utilizar la fecha máxima permitida."},"698":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Selecciona un perfil de emisión existente o configura los `Key Usage` y `Extended Key Usage` en el formulario. Si no eliges un perfil, Lamassu aplica los usos básicos predeterminados."},"699":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Confirma el formulario. La CA debe aparecer en el inventario con su certificado PEM, estado, fecha de expiración y relación de certificados emitidos."},"700":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Una CA no puede emitir certificados que superen su propia fecha de expiración. Deja margen suficiente para renovar o sustituir la autoridad sin interrumpir a los consumidores."},"701":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Selecciona &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** cuando la clave ya esté registrada en Lamassu. El asistente pide primero la clave de soporte y después muestra la misma configuración de tipo, identidad, validez y perfil."},"702":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Este flujo resulta útil cuando la clave se creó previamente en un HSM, se importó mediante BYOK o debe reutilizarse con una política de custodia concreta."},"703":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#importa-una-ca-externa","content":"La importación conserva una autoridad creada fuera de Lamassu."},"704":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#selecciona-el-motor","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave importada."},"705":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#carga-el-material","content":"Proporciona el certificado de CA y la clave privada en formato PEM. Para una CA subordinada, añade opcionalmente la cadena de validación."},"706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-emisión-predeterminada","content":"Configura la validez que recibirán los certificados finales cuando una solicitud no indique otra duración."},"707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Lamassu comprueba que el certificado pertenece a una CA y que el material es coherente antes de registrarlo."},"708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Si no dispones de la clave privada, importa únicamente el certificado. La autoridad podrá formar parte de cadenas de confianza y procesos de validación, pero no podrá emitir certificados desde Lamassu."},"709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Abre una CA desde el inventario para consultar:"},"710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Estado y periodo de validez."},"711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Certificado y cadena en formato PEM."},"712":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Número de certificados activos, expirados y revocados."},"713":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Certificados emitidos en **Issued Certificates**."},"714":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"CRL vinculada a la autoridad."},"715":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Metadatos y motor criptográfico asociado."},"716":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Puedes filtrar el inventario por nombre, estado y tipo de CA."},"717":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Puedes iniciar una emisión desde **Issued Certificates**, desde la acción de una CA o desde el inventario global de certificados."},"718":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"**Generate Key & CSR in Browser** resulta útil para una operación manual o una prueba rápida. El navegador genera la clave y debes descargarla al finalizar."},"719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"**Upload Existing CSR** es la opción adecuada cuando la clave debe permanecer en el sistema de destino. Lamassu recibe la solicitud, pero nunca la clave privada."},"720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Sigue Emite tu primer certificado para el flujo guiado. La gestión de certificados explica el inventario, la inspección y la revocación."},"721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#revoca-una-ca","content":"Revocar una CA invalida la confianza en los certificados que ha emitido y puede interrumpir dispositivos y servicios. La acción es irreversible."},"722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#evalúa-el-impacto","content":"Identifica los certificados, dispositivos y consumidores que dependen de la CA. Prepara una autoridad y una cadena de sustitución cuando sea necesario."},"723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inicia-la-revocación","content":"Abre la autoridad y selecciona **Revoke CA**. Elige la razón que describa el incidente, por ejemplo `KeyCompromise`, `CACompromise`, `Superseded` o `CessationOfOperation`."},"724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#confirma-la-identidad","content":"Escribe exactamente el nombre de la CA para habilitar **Confirm Revocation**."},"725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"El estado debe cambiar a **REVOKED** y la CRL debe reflejar la nueva información. La CA deja de poder emitir certificados."},"726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"La eliminación permanente solo está disponible después de revocar. Elimina el registro únicamente cuando la política de retención y auditoría lo permita."},"727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"page","content":"Perfiles de certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles"},"728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","content":"Define políticas reutilizables para emitir certificados coherentes y limitar las claves aceptadas."},"729":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#qué-controla-un-perfil","content":"Qué controla un perfil"},"730":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#validez","content":"Validez"},"731":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#certificado-de-ca-o-certificado-final","content":"Certificado de CA o certificado final"},"732":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"Key Usage y Extended Key Usage"},"733":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#sujeto","content":"Sujeto"},"734":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#extensiones-de-la-csr","content":"Extensiones de la CSR"},"735":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"Restricciones criptográficas"},"736":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Precedencia del perfil"},"737":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#crea-un-perfil","content":"Crea un perfil"},"738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#define-un-único-propósito","content":"Define un único propósito"},"739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#elige-la-validez","content":"Elige la validez"},"740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#fija-usos-y-sujeto","content":"Fija usos y sujeto"},"741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restringe-las-claves","content":"Restringe las claves"},"742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#asócialo-y-prueba","content":"Asócialo y prueba"},"743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"Ejemplos de diseño"},"744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#cambios-y-eliminación","content":"Cambios y eliminación"},"745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","content":"Un perfil de emisión convierte una política de certificados en configuración reutilizable. En lugar de decidir validez, sujeto, extensiones y algoritmos en cada solicitud, defines una vez qué está permitido y asocias el perfil a una CA, un DMS o una emisión concreta."},"746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#validez","content":"Puedes expresar la vigencia como una duración desde el momento de emisión o como una fecha final fija. Una duración funciona bien para identidades recurrentes; una fecha común sirve para hacer que todo un lote termine antes de una migración o retirada."},"747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#validez","content":"La fecha final nunca debe superar la de la CA emisora."},"748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#certificado-de-ca-o-certificado-final","content":"`Sign as CA` establece `IsCA` y las restricciones básicas necesarias para una autoridad. Actívalo solo en perfiles destinados a crear o reemitir CAs subordinadas."},"749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"El perfil puede imponer usos como `DigitalSignature`, `KeyEncipherment`, `CertSign`, `CRLSign`, `ClientAuth`, `ServerAuth` u `OCSPSigning`."},"750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"Si activas **Honor Key Usage** o **Honor Extended Key Usages**, Lamassu conserva los valores solicitados por la CSR. Si los desactivas, los sustituye por los definidos en el perfil."},"751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#key-usage-y-extended-key-usage","content":"No habilites las opciones `Honor…` para solicitudes no confiables salvo que otro componente valide esos campos. De lo contrario, el solicitante puede elegir capacidades más amplias de las previstas."},"752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#sujeto","content":"Con **Honor Subject**, el certificado conserva el sujeto de la CSR. Sin esa opción, Lamassu aplica `CN`, `O`, `OU`, `C`, `ST` y `L` del perfil. Si el perfil no define `Common Name`, se conserva el CN solicitado."},"753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#extensiones-de-la-csr","content":"Con **Honor Extensions**, Lamassu filtra las extensiones adicionales solicitadas y conserva únicamente SAN. Sin esa opción, descarta las extensiones adicionales de la CSR."},"754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#extensiones-de-la-csr","content":"Este comportamiento permite aceptar DNS, IP, correo o URI como identidades alternativas sin aceptar extensiones arbitrarias."},"755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"La aplicación criptográfica puede:"},"756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"permitir o bloquear claves RSA;"},"757":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"limitar los tamaños RSA admitidos;"},"758":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"permitir o bloquear claves ECDSA;"},"759":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"limitar los tamaños o curvas ECDSA admitidos."},"760":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restricciones-criptográficas","content":"Cuando está habilitada, Lamassu comprueba la clave pública antes de crear una CA o firmar una CSR. Una clave cuyo tipo o tamaño no figure en el perfil se rechaza."},"761":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"En operaciones que admiten varias fuentes, Lamassu resuelve el perfil en este orden:"},"762":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Perfil enviado dentro de la operación."},"763":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Identificador de perfil enviado en la operación."},"764":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Perfil predeterminado asociado a la CA."},"765":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#precedencia-del-perfil","content":"Un DMS también puede referenciar su propio perfil de emisión. De este modo, varias flotas pueden usar la misma CA con políticas distintas."},"766":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#define-un-único-propósito","content":"Separa, por ejemplo, dispositivos mTLS, servidores y CAs intermedias. Un perfil pequeño y específico es más fácil de revisar que uno que permita todos los usos."},"767":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#elige-la-validez","content":"Alinea la duración con la capacidad real de renovación de la flota. Deja margen respecto a la expiración de la CA."},"768":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#fija-usos-y-sujeto","content":"Para un dispositivo que se autentica como cliente, el punto de partida habitual es `DigitalSignature` y `ClientAuth`. Añade `ServerAuth` o `KeyEncipherment` solo si el protocolo lo necesita."},"769":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#restringe-las-claves","content":"Habilita la aplicación criptográfica y enumera únicamente algoritmos y tamaños compatibles con tu política y tus dispositivos."},"770":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#asócialo-y-prueba","content":"Asocia el perfil a una CA o DMS. Emite un certificado de prueba y comprueba sujeto, SAN, KU, EKU, restricciones básicas y fechas con una herramienta X.509 independiente."},"771":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"**Dispositivo mTLS**\\\nCertificado final, validez corta, `DigitalSignature`, `ClientAuth`, sujeto controlado por el DMS y SAN permitido cuando identifica al dispositivo."},"772":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"**Servidor TLS**\\\nCertificado final, `DigitalSignature`, `ServerAuth` y SAN obligatorio con los nombres que utilizarán los clientes."},"773":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"**CA intermedia**\\\n`Sign as CA`, `CertSign` y `CRLSign`, validez superior a sus certificados finales y restricciones criptográficas más exigentes."},"774":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#ejemplos-de-diseño","content":"Son patrones de partida, no una política universal. Verifica siempre los requisitos del protocolo, del consumidor y del marco regulatorio aplicable."},"775":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#cambios-y-eliminación","content":"Actualizar un perfil afecta a emisiones futuras; no modifica certificados ya firmados. Prueba los cambios antes de aplicarlos a una CA en producción y conserva la justificación operativa."},"776":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles#cambios-y-eliminación","content":"Antes de eliminar un perfil, comprueba que ninguna CA o DMS dependa de él. Si deseas sustituirlo, crea la versión nueva, actualiza las referencias y realiza una emisión de prueba antes de retirar el anterior."},"777":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","type":"page","content":"Validación de certificados","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation"},"778":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","content":"Publica el estado de las identidades mediante OCSP y CRL."},"779":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Elige un mecanismo"},"780":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","content":"La emisión demuestra quién firmó un certificado; la validación permite saber si todavía debe aceptarse. Lamassu publica el estado mediante dos mecanismos complementarios."},"781":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Usa **OCSP** cuando el consumidor esté conectado y necesite consultar el estado más reciente de un certificado concreto."},"782":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Usa una **CRL** cuando la validación deba realizarse localmente, sin conexión o sobre un volumen elevado de certificados. El consumidor descarga periódicamente una lista firmada y la conserva hasta la siguiente actualización."},"783":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Muchos entornos utilizan ambos: OCSP como comprobación primaria y CRL como mecanismo local o de respaldo."},"784":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"<Card title=\"Validación online con OCSP\" description=\"Consulta estados Good, Revoked y Unknown en tiempo real.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"785":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"<Card title=\"Listas de revocación\" description=\"Genera, publica y distribuye CRLs por autoridad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"786":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"page","content":"Certificados","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates"},"787":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","content":"Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu."},"788":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Busca un certificado"},"789":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#descarga-el-certificado","content":"Descarga el certificado"},"790":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#revoca-un-certificado","content":"Revoca un certificado"},"791":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#abre-la-acción","content":"Abre la acción"},"792":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#elige-una-razón","content":"Elige una razón"},"793":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Confirma y verifica"},"794":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"Continúa"},"795":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","content":"El inventario de certificados ofrece una vista global de las identidades emitidas por todas las autoridades. También puedes abrir **Issued Certificates** dentro de una CA para limitar la vista a ese emisor."},"796":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Abre **Certificates** y filtra por:"},"797":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"`Common Name` del sujeto."},"798":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Número de serie."},"799":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Estado."},"800":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Autoridad emisora."},"801":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Utiliza **Quick Inspect** para una comprobación rápida o **View Details** para ver el sujeto, SANs, usos, cadena, periodo de validez y metadatos completos."},"802":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#descarga-el-certificado","content":"La acción de descarga entrega el certificado en formato PEM. Si el certificado se emitió mediante un CSR externo, la clave privada permanece en el sistema que generó ese CSR. Si se generó en el navegador, la clave solo estuvo disponible al finalizar la emisión."},"803":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#revoca-un-certificado","content":"Revoca una identidad cuando la clave se haya comprometido, el sujeto ya no esté autorizado o el certificado deba dejar de aceptarse antes de expirar."},"804":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#abre-la-acción","content":"En el inventario o la vista de detalle, selecciona **Revoke Certificate**."},"805":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#elige-una-razón","content":"Selecciona la razón que represente el incidente. Esta información se publica en OCSP y en la CRL."},"806":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Confirma la operación y comprueba que el estado sea **Revoked**. Si la CA regenera la CRL al revocar, verifica también que exista una versión nueva."},"807":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Una revocación con la razón `CertificateHold` puede reactivarse. Las demás razones producen una revocación definitiva."},"808":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"<Card title=\"Validar con OCSP\" description=\"Consulta el estado de un certificado en tiempo real.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"809":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"<Card title=\"Distribuir una CRL\" description=\"Publica el estado para validación offline.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"810":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp","type":"page","content":"Enrolamiento de dispositivos con CMP","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp"},"811":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp","content":"Guía del protocolo CMP en Lamassu IoT, con la referencia completa de ajustes generales y por operación del DMS, y la referencia de operaciones para el integrador de dispositivos."},"812":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp#cmp-certificate-management-protocol","content":"CMP: Certificate Management Protocol"},"813":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/cmp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/pla