istente, elija **Generate New Key Pair** y después defina los parámetros principales:"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Key Name**: nombre único y descriptivo."},"2107":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor que custodiará la clave."},"2108":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Key Type** y **Key Size**: algoritmo y tamaño o curva."},"2109":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Tags**: metadatos para clasificar la clave."},"2110":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-nuevo-par-de-claves","content":"**Metadata**: información adicional para usos avanzados."},"2111":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"La importación permite registrar en Lamassu una clave gener