-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser**. Usa **Upload Existing CSR** cuando la clave privada deba generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino."},"2266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce el `Common Name` y, si corresponde, la organización, unidad organizativa y ubicación. Añade SANs para cada nombre DNS, dirección IP, correo o URI con el que se vaya a validar la identidad."},"2267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige RSA o ECDSA, define la validez y selecciona los usos de clave. Para una identidad de dispositivo que usa mTLS, habilita **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication**."},"2268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"La validez no puede superar la fecha de expiración de la CA emisora."},"2269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión y descarga inmediatamente el certificado y la clave privada en formato PEM."},"2270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El certificado debe aparecer en **Issued Certificates** con estado activo. Comprueba su sujeto, SANs, emisor, usos y periodo de validez."},"2271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registra tu primer dispositivo para asociar la identidad a una entidad gestionada, o consulta la gestión de certificados."},"2272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Primeros pasos","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Obtén un primer resultado con Lamassu y continúa desde una base funcional."},"2274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"Ruta recomendada"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstar