":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Registra el dispositivo"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Comprueba el estado inicial"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Asigna una identidad"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Verifica el dispositivo"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Automatiza el siguiente dispositivo"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","content":"En este quickstart registrarás manualmente un dispositivo y le asignarás su primer certificado. Es el recorrido más corto para entender cómo Lamassu relaciona una entidad física con su historial de identidades."},"2291":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un DMS configurado."},"2292":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA asociada al DMS."},"2293":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador único para el dispositivo."},"2294":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices**, selecciona la acción para registrar un dispositivo y completa:"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: identificador único del dispositivo."},"2296":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: DMS que aplicará las políticas de enrolamiento."},"2297":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional para localizarlo después."},"2298":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo recién creado. Debe aparecer con estado **No Identity**: existe en el inventario, pero todavía no tiene un certificado asociado."},"2299":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity**. Lamassu buscará certificados activos cuyo `Common Name` coincida con el `Device ID`."},"2300":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona un certificado existente o usa **Issue New Instead** para emitir uno desde una CA vinculada al DMS."},"2301":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Tras confirmar, el estado debe cambiar a **Active**. Revisa **Certificate History** para comprobar la identidad asociada y **Device Event Timeline** para ver el evento de asignación."},"2302":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"El registro manual ayuda a entender el modelo, pero una flota debe usar enrolamiento automatizado. Continúa con Device Management Service y la integración EST o CMP."},"2303":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica acceso, salud, emisión, enrolamiento y dependencias en un despliegue de Lamassu."},"2305":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#secuencia-de-diagnóstico","content":"Secuencia de diagnóstico"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Reproduce una sola operación"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Separa cliente, Gateway y servicio"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Revisa el estado de Kubernetes"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Consulta el servicio afectado"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Valida el resultado desde fuera"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"La emisión falla"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway, un pod no preparado y una emisión rechazada pueden parecer el mismo problema desde la consola, pero requieren evidencias distintas."},"2321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"2322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"2323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"2324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"2325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"2326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"2327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"2329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"2330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":